WEBVTT

00:05:29.807 --> 00:05:31.601
protected the site,

00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:33.143
found artifacts,

00:05:33.167 --> 00:05:35.680
extended Boston's history

00:05:35.704 --> 00:05:38.267
and then moved forward
with the renovation.

00:05:38.942 --> 00:05:43.164
If that isn't a reflection
of radical imagination in government,

00:05:43.188 --> 00:05:45.069
I don't know what is.

00:05:45.093 --> 00:05:47.180
What sounds simple

00:05:47.204 --> 00:05:51.886
is actually transformational
for the people and communities involved.

00:05:52.307 --> 00:05:56.490
I'm seeing community members
shape transportation access,

00:05:56.514 --> 00:05:58.136
improve their schools

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.398
and even transform government buildings,